==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|про-|лете́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пролете́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пролететь.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|пролете́ть|pf|impf=пролета́ть}}

# to [[fly]] ''(by, past, through)'', to [[fly]] ''(over)''
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=w:ru:Фёдор Сологуб<t:{{w|Fyodor Sologub}}>
|title=w:ru:Мелкий бес|chapter=XXIII|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=John Cournos and Richard Aldington|title2=w:[[The Petty Demon|The Little Demon]]|location2=New York|publisher2=w:en:Alfred A. Knopf|year2=1916|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=— Глаз-пти́ца '''пролете́ла''', — угрю́мо сказа́л Передо́нов [...]|t=" The eye-bird '''flew by'''," said Peredonov morosely [...]}}
# to [[overfly]], to [[overshoot]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы]] '''пролете́ли''' [[знак]] "[[стоп]]"|we overshot the [stop] sign}}
# to [[cover]], to [[pass]] [[rapidly]]
# ''(time)'' to [[fly by]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''пролете́ли''' [[два|две]] [[неделя|неде́ли]]|two weeks flew by}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[be]] [[passed]] [[over]] ''(for)'', to [[miss the mark]], to [[miss the boat]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он]] '''пролете́л''' [[с]] [[повышение|повыше́нием]]|he was passed over for}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf-intr|5b|пролете́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{m|ru|пролёт}}, {{m|ru|пролётка}}
